    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0086" n="74" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg74"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">884.24/9–2944: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Ethiopia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-29T20:00:00-04:00">September 29,
                            1944—8 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>141. Military equipment including 5,000 rifles, 5 armored cars, twelve 37mm.
                    field guns, four 75mm. field guns, fifty 30 cal. Browning <pb facs="0087" n="75"
                        xml:id="pg75"/> machine guns, fifty 45 cal. submachine guns and ammunition
                    has been assigned to Ethiopia and will probably be shipped within a month. Date
                    of shipment will be announced to you as soon as known.</p>
                <p>Please inform Ethiopian Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
